1
00:00:06,013 --> 00:00:07,040
I'm sorry...

2
00:00:07,188 --> 00:00:09,685
I panicked and didn't even realize...

3
00:00:10,343 --> 00:00:11,811
It's fine.

4
00:00:12,524 --> 00:00:13,895
So now what.

5
00:00:15,756 --> 00:00:16,891
But...

6
00:00:16,916 --> 00:00:18,717
can we, like, do something about that body.

7
00:00:34,330 --> 00:00:35,607
You okay now?

8
00:00:36,342 --> 00:00:37,576
Uh… yeah…

9
00:00:37,601 --> 00:00:38,708
thank you.

10
00:00:39,829 --> 00:00:41,083
Alright then,

11
00:00:41,224 --> 00:00:43,036
let's find someone who can help.

12
00:00:43,224 --> 00:00:44,778
I'll go look around outside,

13
00:00:44,778 --> 00:00:46,497
you stay here and keep watching.

14
00:00:46,547 --> 00:00:47,736
Wait a second.

15
00:00:48,554 --> 00:00:50,158
You want me to stay here alone?

16
00:00:50,183 --> 00:00:51,217
Yeah.

17
00:00:51,217 --> 00:00:52,752
What if the killer comes back,

18
00:00:52,752 --> 00:00:53,740
what about me?

19
00:00:53,765 --> 00:00:54,633
What do you think?

20
00:00:54,658 --> 00:00:56,919
Either take them down or get taken down.

21
00:01:02,076 --> 00:01:02,743
What are you doing?

22
00:01:02,768 --> 00:01:03,438
No way.

23
00:01:03,463 --> 00:01:04,497
I'm staying right here.

24
00:01:04,497 --> 00:01:05,265
Move.

25
00:01:05,265 --> 00:01:06,266
Come on, don't be like that.

26
00:01:06,266 --> 00:01:07,290
Why don't we just...

27
00:01:07,845 --> 00:01:09,658
Then you go out.

28
00:01:09,683 --> 00:01:11,954
No... I didn't mean it like that...

29
00:01:13,974 --> 00:01:15,543
You are freaking me out.

30
00:01:19,979 --> 00:01:21,447
We're Fucked...

31
00:01:21,682 --> 00:01:23,017
Ugh...

32
00:01:26,273 --> 00:01:28,025
Damn it...

33
00:01:31,779 --> 00:01:33,381
What do we do now?

34
00:01:35,249 --> 00:01:36,297
We hold out.

35
00:01:36,322 --> 00:01:37,664
Hold out for what?

36
00:01:37,664 --> 00:01:39,337
Until someone steps on me.

37
00:01:39,790 --> 00:01:40,900
Someone's bound to show up

38
00:01:40,900 --> 00:01:42,068
and then we can get out of here.

39
00:01:42,068 --> 00:01:44,126
We just need to hang in till then.

40
00:01:44,314 --> 00:01:45,751
We're literally next to a dead body.

41
00:01:45,776 --> 00:01:47,790
What if the killer comes back any second?

42
00:01:47,967 --> 00:01:50,118
Come up with something better.

43
00:01:51,525 --> 00:01:52,893
You really wanna leave?

44
00:01:52,918 --> 00:01:54,253
Of course I do.

45
00:01:54,278 --> 00:01:56,189
Out of all people, I'm stuck here with you.

46
00:01:58,055 --> 00:01:59,089
Why?

47
00:01:59,114 --> 00:02:00,462
You hate being with me?

48
00:02:02,215 --> 00:02:04,501
I mean... why would I like it...

49
00:02:06,090 --> 00:02:08,159
What... why?

50
00:02:09,424 --> 00:02:12,525
I don't know just... it's a shame.

51
00:02:13,383 --> 00:02:14,550
About what??

52
00:02:14,575 --> 00:02:15,572
What?

53
00:02:16,791 --> 00:02:20,469
I mean, I kinda like
being stuck here with you.

54
00:02:22,509 --> 00:02:23,876
What are you talking about?

55
00:02:23,901 --> 00:02:25,502
Shouldn't you be texting your girlfriend?

56
00:02:25,527 --> 00:02:27,162
Chaewon sunbae must be worried.

57
00:02:27,187 --> 00:02:28,388
Girlfriend?

58
00:02:28,414 --> 00:02:30,064
Yeah, Chaewon sunbae.

59
00:02:30,089 --> 00:02:31,556
Aren't you two dating?

60
00:02:33,462 --> 00:02:34,387
Why?

61
00:02:34,387 --> 00:02:35,673
You think I wouldn't know?

62
00:02:36,456 --> 00:02:37,457
What?

63
00:02:37,457 --> 00:02:38,267
What's with you?

64
00:02:38,292 --> 00:02:40,602
Is that why you said
you hate being stuck with me?

65
00:02:40,627 --> 00:02:41,493
Obviously,

66
00:02:41,518 --> 00:02:42,822
it's not like anything would...

67
00:02:43,056 --> 00:02:44,267
Would what?

68
00:02:46,117 --> 00:02:47,652
Ugh... I don't know.

69
00:02:50,837 --> 00:02:52,251
I'm not dating her.

70
00:02:53,087 --> 00:02:53,873
Huh?

71
00:02:53,873 --> 00:02:54,641
So then...

72
00:02:54,641 --> 00:02:56,228
She's just my ride-or-die bro.

73
00:02:57,398 --> 00:02:59,736
What kind of bro acts that sweet though?

74
00:03:00,246 --> 00:03:02,447
Only sweet when you're around.

75
00:03:03,057 --> 00:03:04,400
Because I'm around?

76
00:03:04,505 --> 00:03:05,822
What does that even mean?

77
00:03:06,119 --> 00:03:07,173
Mm...

78
00:03:08,556 --> 00:03:10,017
Gwangmin, I know...

79
00:03:11,332 --> 00:03:13,268
how much I like you.

80
00:03:13,293 --> 00:03:14,392
Huh?

81
00:03:14,761 --> 00:03:15,798
You...

82
00:03:16,368 --> 00:03:17,595
You like me?

83
00:03:18,064 --> 00:03:20,173
Yeah, you.

84
00:04:06,145 --> 00:04:12,318
"Don't Confess Next a Corpse"
